[Destructive] DROP TRIGGER tr ON public.t  -- aynı transaction içinde yeniden kurulur
[Safe] CREATE TRIGGER tr AFTER INSERT ON public.t FOR EACH ROW EXECUTE FUNCTION public.tf()
[Safe] ALTER TABLE public.t ENABLE ALWAYS TRIGGER tr
[Safe] COMMENT ON TRIGGER tr ON public.t IS 'c'
